    },
    {
      "id": "claim_4278c66431c14f849edc97bc27eeb04f",
      "statement": "Inconsistency state is stored per Metamodel: InconsistencyStatesImpl is an EnumMap<Metamodel, InconsistencyStateImpl> with one state per Metamodel value, InconsistencyStateImpl holds recommendedInstances and a duplicate-free inconsistencies list, and MissingElementInconsistencyCandidate support is the count of distinct support kinds with equality keyed only by the wrapped RecommendedInstance; only ELEMENT_WITH_NO_TRACE_LINK and MULTIPLE_OVERLAPPING_RECOMMENDED_INSTANCES supports are currently produced.",
